<title>USA: Exabyte supplies Tape Backup to Compaq.</title>
<headline>Exabyte supplies Tape Backup to Compaq.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exabyte Corp on Wednesday said its Eagle TR-4i Tape Backup System will be offered by Compaq Computer Corp as an option for its desktop personal computers.</p>
<p>Exabyte said the system will also be sold seprately as an accessory item under the Compaq brand name.</p>
<p>Financial details of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
